 These data support continued investigation of antiviral treatment modalities that include both NAI and CENI for patients with mild and severe A(H5N1) disease.	Oseltamivir and baloxavir monotherapy and combination therapy efficacy against clade 2.3.4.4b A(H5N1) influenza virus infection in ferrets	Other	SRA2245655	SUB15691868	Centers for Disease Control and Prevention	Influenza Division
